\"noopener noreferrer\">下载免费报告</a></div><h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm\" data-testid=\"Text-h3\"><b>可穿戴科技应用迈入变现新阶段</b></h3><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">2016年至2025年，全球可穿戴科技应用下载量增长至原来的约6.6倍，但自2023年末以来，下载量增速有所放缓。与此同时，应用内购收入仍在增长。2026年前九个月的应用内购收入已达到2025年全年总额的96%。这表明，新增用户增长放缓的同时，应用内购收入仍保持增长。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">各地区市场表现也有明显差异。2026年第一季度至第三季度，印度可穿戴科技应用下载量接近5000万次，位居全球第1。美国应用内购收入达到8540万美元，约占全球可穿戴科技应用内购总收入的60%。报告也分析了不同市场在应用下载和收入方面的表现。</p><img title=\"-CN- 2026 Wearable Technology Report(pg10)\" alt=\"-CN- 2026 Wearable Technology Report(pg10)\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2038\" height=\"1148\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5XECbFh9yWq5SchHYKVgSa/53c275906ec0a872a471136427ac600c/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg10_.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5XECbFh9yWq5SchHYKVgSa/53c275906ec0a872a471136427ac600c/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg10_.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5XECbFh9yWq5SchHYKVgSa/53c275906ec0a872a471136427ac600c/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg10_.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5XECbFh9yWq5SchHYKVgSa/53c275906ec0a872a471136427ac600c/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg10_.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5XECbFh9yWq5SchHYKVgSa/53c275906ec0a872a471136427ac600c/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg10_.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5XECbFh9yWq5SchHYKVgSa/53c275906ec0a872a471136427ac600c/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg10_.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5XECbFh9yWq5SchHYKVgSa/53c275906ec0a872a471136427ac600c/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg10_.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5XECbFh9yWq5SchHYKVgSa/53c275906ec0a872a471136427ac600c/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg10_.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5XECbFh9yWq5SchHYKVgSa/53c275906ec0a872a471136427ac600c/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg10_.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5XECbFh9yWq5SchHYKVgSa/53c275906ec0a872a471136427ac600c/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg10_.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm\" data-testid=\"Text-h3\"><b>无屏时代，应用成为产品体验的核心</b></h3><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">2026年第一季度至第三季度，Samsung Health、Mi Fitness 和 Garmin Connect 的月活跃用户数（MAU）位居全球可穿戴科技应用前列。与此同时，随着智能戒指和无屏健身手环的发展，配套应用也变得更加重要，用户主要通过这些应用查看个性化健康数据和分析结果。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">WHOOP 是一个典型案例。其用户平均每天打开应用近7次，约为其他头部可穿戴科技应用用户的两倍。WHOOP 侧重运动表现和身体恢复，Oura 则更关注长期健康监测，包括心血管健康和女性健康。两者均采用会员订阅制，而 Samsung（三星） 和 Ultrahuman 则提供无需强制订阅即可使用智能戒指的核心健康分析功能。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\"><b>品牌之间的竞争已不再局限于硬件。个性化健康分析和日常应用体验，也越来越能体现产品差异，并影响用户是否持续使用。</b></p><img title=\"-CN- 2026 Wearable Technology Report(pg16)\" alt=\"-CN- 2026 Wearable Technology Report(pg16)\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2040\" height=\"1148\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/21T0qdsowbimKwykQ1giJx/5e19a42f58d715b5cf955aba7652f093/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg16_.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/21T0qdsowbimKwykQ1giJx/5e19a42f58d715b5cf955aba7652f093/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg16_.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/21T0qdsowbimKwykQ1giJx/5e19a42f58d715b5cf955aba7652f093/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg16_.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/21T0qdsowbimKwykQ1giJx/5e19a42f58d715b5cf955aba7652f093/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg16_.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/21T0qdsowbimKwykQ1giJx/5e19a42f58d715b5cf955aba7652f093/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg16_.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/21T0qdsowbimKwykQ1giJx/5e19a42f58d715b5cf955aba7652f093/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg16_.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/21T0qdsowbimKwykQ1giJx/5e19a42f58d715b5cf955aba7652f093/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg16_.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/21T0qdsowbimKwykQ1giJx/5e19a42f58d715b5cf955aba7652f093/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg16_.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/21T0qdsowbimKwykQ1giJx/5e19a42f58d715b5cf955aba7652f093/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg16_.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/21T0qdsowbimKwykQ1giJx/5e19a42f58d715b5cf955aba7652f093/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg16_.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm\" data-testid=\"Text-h3\"><b>不同品牌吸引不同的用户群体</b></h3><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">不同可穿戴科技应用面向的健康和生活方式需求各不相同，用户群体也呈现出明显差异。WHOOP 用户中男性占比接近74%，而 Oura 用户中女性占比达到53%，略高于男性。这也反映出两个品牌在运动表现和综合健康管理方面的不同侧重。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">应用亲和度分析进一步展现了不同品牌用户的使用偏好。Oura 用户对 Natural Cycles 的亲和度较高，该应用是 Oura 在生育健康追踪方面的官方合作伙伴。WHOOP 用户使用 F45 Training 的可能性是总体人群的16.5倍，F45 Training 是 WHOOP 的合作健身品牌。此外，Garmin Connect 用户对 Garmin 旗下的 Connect IQ Store 也表现出较高亲和度，显示出 Garmin 用户对品牌旗下其他应用的使用情况。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\"><b>这些数据反映出，不同品牌正通过专业健康功能、品牌合作和应用生态，满足各自用户的不同需求。</b></p><img title=\"wearable-chart\" alt=\"wearable-chart\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2792\" height=\"1574\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Sj4cDJz9a7iTyfopYPFdx/55ddbf16f96ed7744a7bcb0c8a7094d6/Screenshot_2026-11-12_at_19.01.37.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Sj4cDJz9a7iTyfopYPFdx/55ddbf16f96ed7744a7bcb0c8a7094d6/Screenshot_2026-11-12_at_19.01.37.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Sj4cDJz9a7iTyfopYPFdx/55ddbf16f96ed7744a7bcb0c8a7094d6/Screenshot_2026-11-12_at_19.01.37.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Sj4cDJz9a7iTyfopYPFdx/55ddbf16f96ed7744a7bcb0c8a7094d6/Screenshot_2026-11-12_at_19.01.37.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Sj4cDJz9a7iTyfopYPFdx/55ddbf16f96ed7744a7bcb0c8a7094d6/Screenshot_2026-11-12_at_19.01.37.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Sj4cDJz9a7iTyfopYPFdx/55ddbf16f96ed7744a7bcb0c8a7094d6/Screenshot_2026-11-12_at_19.01.37.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Sj4cDJz9a7iTyfopYPFdx/55ddbf16f96ed7744a7bcb0c8a7094d6/Screenshot_2026-11-12_at_19.01.37.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Sj4cDJz9a7iTyfopYPFdx/55ddbf16f96ed7744a7bcb0c8a7094d6/Screenshot_2026-11-12_at_19.01.37.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Sj4cDJz9a7iTyfopYPFdx/55ddbf16f96ed7744a7bcb0c8a7094d6/Screenshot_2026-11-12_at_19.01.37.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Sj4cDJz9a7iTyfopYPFdx/55ddbf16f96ed7744a7bcb0c8a7094d6/Screenshot_2026-11-12_at_19.01.37.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm\" data-testid=\"Text-h3\"><b>从社交媒体到 ChatGPT，可穿戴科技品牌拓展广告渠道</b></h3><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">2026年第一季度至第三季度，可穿戴科技品牌的数字广告展示量达到590亿次，同比增长35%，季度广告支出超过1亿美元。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">除传统社交媒体和视频广告渠道外，WHOOP、Oura、小米、RingConn 和三星也于2026年在 ChatGPT 上投放广告。此外，ChatGPT 带来的流量占 RingConn 网站引荐流量的3.1%，显示 ChatGPT 有望成为传统营销渠道之外的产品发现渠道。</p><img title=\"-CN- 2026 Wearable Technology Report(pg17)\" alt=\"-CN- 2026 Wearable Technology Report(pg17)\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2038\" height=\"1146\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4dqUyKkHxampmDMJEMSsNR/99ceca90793223bc355f5a1b0fbc3f24/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg17_.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4dqUyKkHxampmDMJEMSsNR/99ceca90793223bc355f5a1b0fbc3f24/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg17_.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4dqUyKkHxampmDMJEMSsNR/99ceca90793223bc355f5a1b0fbc3f24/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg17_.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4dqUyKkHxampmDMJEMSsNR/99ceca90793223bc355f5a1b0fbc3f24/-CN-_2026_Wearable_Technology_Report_pg17_.pn